00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:37.349
Maybe he wouldn't if they showed that he lost,
depending on what he thinks about the election

00:02:37.349 --> 00:02:38.349
results.

00:02:38.349 --> 00:02:45.459
Trump has said president for life, like what
China made possible recently is interesting

00:02:45.459 --> 00:02:47.940
and maybe we would try it sometime.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:54.280
Trump has said years ahead of the 2020 election
two years ahead, that the only way Democrats

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:57.360
can defeat them in 2020 is via fraud.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:02.810
That is yet another one of these sort of pretext
to the idea that he might not accept the election

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:03.810
