00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:17.800
And that in reality, if you account for those
three to 5 million alleged illegal votes,

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.780
he won the popular vote as well as the electorial
vote.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:28.439
Trump has made clear that he has a degree
of narcissism that might make him unable emotionally

00:03:28.439 --> 00:03:29.950
