00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:34.739
So when people talk about Trump won't leave
the White House peacefully, if you loses,

00:03:34.739 --> 00:03:38.350
is it more likely that he would try to retain
power?

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:41.069
Uh, then would someone like Barack Obama?

00:03:41.069 --> 00:03:42.900
Obviously the answer is yes.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:48.250
Is it likely Trump would succeed if he tried
at not relinquishing the White House?

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:49.510
I don't think is very likely.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:55.110
So what what we need to do is let's just work
on voting him out rather than focusing on

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.090
whether or not he would leave.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:01.719
Let's work on preventing voter suppression
and manipulation tactics to actually hand

00:04:01.719 --> 00:04:06.220
Donald Trump the victory because much more
likely than Trump loses and somehow stays

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:11.959
