00:04:17.989 --> 00:04:20.580
push Donald Trump into victory.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:23.199
That's what we need to most proactively be
working to prevent.

00:04:23.199 --> 00:04:28.130
I agree with William Weld that if Trump tries
not to give up control of the White House,

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:32.580
uh, that the forces of power, I know that
the Justice Department in the tank forum,

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:36.090
I know all of that stuff, but I think that
that would even be too far.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.310
I think that he would ultimately be removed.

